 record for Strafford County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, May to June came in under 90% of normal in 39 years, the most of any pair. In 2025 that middle ran 53% of normal in July to August and 135% in April to May. So far in 2026 it sits at 50% for January to February, and a preliminary estimate puts July to August 2026 at 50.2 on grid 28437.</p>"}
